  "note": "dts2-harness@dts2 replaces harness@harness. Enable one, not both. Tiers (machine-prep --tier, default claude.defaultTier): light disables only plugins with no use in the usage window; standard keeps the marketplace keep-set plus the top keepSyncedTopN used synced plugins plus keepSyncedPlugins; strict also sets syncClaudeAiPlugins and syncClaudeAiSkills to false. requiredByHarness ids (glob) are never disabled. claude.ai and Cowork keep their plugins in every tier.",
